  "description": "MmapCache stores data in off-heap memory-mapped (`mmap`) segment files utilizing a lock-free LSM (Log-Structured Merge-tree) architecture. \n\t\t\tIt fully supports WAL (Write-Ahead Log) crash-recovery, active live mutations, automatic background compaction, and completely lock-free segment reads.",
